/*
 * headless_opattributes_verbs.c - Opattributes processor verb stubs
 *
 * Originally generated by tools/kernelverbs_parser/generate_processor_stubs.py,
 * now contains stub implementations for opattributes verbs.
 *
 * DO NOT regenerate - this file contains stub implementations.
 *
 * NOTE (2026-01-12): opattributes is a GUI-centric feature for managing
 * binary attributes stored in outline node refcon. In headless CLI mode,
 * these operations are not supported since:
 * 1. No outline target available (op.attributes works on current node in GUI)
 * 2. Attribute serialization is complex and GUI-specific
 * 3. No real use cases for CLI operations
 *
 * This follows the pattern of other GUI-only verbs (op.hoist, op.dehoist).
 *
 * Future: For GUI builds, implement full pack/unpack with BE64 compliance.
 *
 * @STUB - Returns "not supported in headless mode" errors
 */

